# Timesheet Calculator - environment variables (names only, never real values).
# The desktop app needs none of them; they exist for development and tests.

# TSC_CONFIG_DIR       Override the config directory (default %APPDATA%/timesheet-calculator/).
# TSC_LOG_LEVEL        info | debug - log level of the local log file.
# TSC_SEED_FILE        Path to a JSON list of employees loaded when the store is empty (dev).
# TSC_SEED_KETQUAKY    Path to a JSON map of saved periods loaded when none exist (dashboard demo).
# TSC_MAU_BANG_LUONG   Override the payroll template path - only when not packaged (dev/test).
